# init.te -- extra init permissions for the U2 platform.
#
# The AOSP init domain is already broad enough to start the helper declared in
# u2_btaudio.te via init_daemon_domain().  No additional init rules are required
# for the current design.  If a real build surfaces an `avc: denied` against init
# (e.g. mounting a custom fstab entry), add the narrowly-scoped allow rule HERE
# after review -- do not grant init broad filesystem access.
#
# This file is intentionally empty of rules.
